NanoKVM TPU programs (nanokvm-tpu-sg2002)

nanokvm-ocr and nanokvm-screen (tpu/helpers): GPL-3.0-or-later, part of
NanoKVM OS.

They are linked statically with:

- Sophgo's cviruntime and cvikernel, as ported to dma-buf heaps in
  https://github.com/leafpmpmp/duo-buildroot-sdk-v2 (branch mainline-tpu),
  and the code generated from Sophgo's model schema (cvibuilder). Sophgo
  publishes them without a licence file; the source files carry Sophgo or
  Cvitek copyright notices. As for the other SOPHGO components without a
  licence grant (docs/DISTRIBUTION.md), the source is fetched from that
  repository at build time and not redistributed here.
- flatbuffers headers: Apache-2.0.
- LZ4 and xxHash, inside cviruntime: BSD-2-Clause.
- libstdc++ and libgcc: GPL-3.0 with the GCC Runtime Library Exception.

The models are separate add-ons, each with its own notice.
